  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The following are the intermediary companies in the chain of ownership between BP p.l.c. and the direct parent:--BP p.l.c. owns 100% of BP Holdings North America Limited. &gt;--BP Holdings North America Limited owns 100% of BP America Limited. &gt;--BP America Limited owns 100% of BP America Inc. &gt;--BP America Inc. owns 100% of BP Corporation North America Inc. &gt;--BP Corporation North America Inc. owns 100% of BP Company North America Inc. &gt;--BP Company North America Inc. owns 100% of The Standard Oil Company. &gt;--The Standard Oil Company owns 100% of BP Pipelines (North America) Inc. &gt;--BP Pipelines (North America) Inc. owns 51% of BP Midwest Product Pipelines Holdings LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="f-52" xlink:href="#f-52"/>
